---
output: svg
---
@startuml
' Same bug as reported_case.puml, but with the colors declared in the
' opposite order: the fix must not simply make "the first note win"
' instead of "the last note wins" -- each note must keep its own color
' regardless of parsing order.
class B {
  int lightblue
  int yellow
}
note right of B::lightblue #lightblue
  Hello lightblue
end note
note right of B::yellow #yellow
  Hello yellow
end note
@enduml
